# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ERICK COLOR LAB — .gitignore
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PRIVATE / THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL — NEVER COMMIT
# Any third-party LUT pack used only as a study reference (e.g. FJR material)
# must stay outside the repository or inside these ignored folders.
private/
reference-private/
third-party/
**/*FJR*
**/*fjr*
**/*La Creme*
**/*La_Creme*
**/*la-creme*
**/*.drx
**/*.xmp
**/*.dng
**/*.dcp

# Client / personal footage used for local look tests (licensing + privacy).
test-media/*
!test-media/README.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# BUILD ARTIFACTS
# Commercial LUT files are reproducible build outputs (scripts/build_luts.py).
# They are not committed: the repository is public and the files are the
# commercial product. The manifest (checksums) and reports ARE committed.
exports/**/*.cube
exports/**/*.zip
dist/
build/
release/

# Large preview renders (keep the small committed contact sheets / reports)
previews/**/*_full.png
previews/**/*.exr
previews/**/*.tif

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python / tooling
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# OS / editors
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
